# Gold - Time Tracking Application

## Project Vision

A modern, intuitive time-tracking application inspired by Clockify and Toggl Track, built with Ruby on Rails and PostgreSQL. The app enables developers and teams to track time effortlessly, manage projects, and generate detailed reports. Designed from day one to support a Phase 2 Jira integration where developers can select tasks directly from their issue tracker instead of typing descriptions manually.

## Tech Stack

- **Backend:** Ruby on Rails 8.1, PostgreSQL
- **Frontend:** Tailwind CSS + DaisyUI 
- **JavaScript:** Hotwire (Turbo + Stimulus) -- no heavy JS frameworks
- **Charts:** Chart.js or ApexCharts via Stimulus controllers
- **Date Picker:** Flatpickr via Stimulus controller
- **Design System:** DaisyUI -- chosen for zero JS footprint, 35 built-in themes, semantic class names (`btn btn-primary` vs raw Tailwind), excellent Rails/Hotwire compatibility, and strong dashboard component support (stat cards, tables, badges, tabs, progress bars)

