## Key Interactions (Stimulus Controllers)

1. **TimerController** -- manages start/stop/resume, elapsed time display, real-time counter
2. **TimeEntryFormController** -- inline editing, project/task/tag selectors with search
3. **TimesheetController** -- grid cell editing, auto-save on blur, row/column totals
4. **ReportFilterController** -- filter bar state management, Turbo Frame updates on filter change
5. **ChartController** -- render Chart.js/ApexCharts from data attributes
6. **DateRangePickerController** -- Flatpickr wrapper with presets
7. **ProjectSelectorController** -- searchable dropdown with color dots, extensible for Phase 2 Jira task picker
8. **ThemeController** -- DaisyUI theme switcher

